    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "z amon-\nNORTHWEST\nCORER™BSE\nNorthwest Airlines Martin Luxury Liners- Coast To Coast",
      "POST\nNWA\nCARD\nPlease address,\nstamp, and return\nto stewardess who\nwill mail for you.\nYou'll thrill at the power and amazing speed of these\nmodern, postwar twin-engine Martin luxury liners.\nEvery new feature of comfort, convenience and per-\nformance is included. Built-in loading steps, reversi-\nble pitch propellers, soft, reclining seats, modern\nequipped galley, and large \"picture\" windows are\njust a few of the things you'll like about travelling\nNorthwest Martins on short fast routes from Coast\nto Coast.\nPF 16-B-50\nNORTHWEST AIRLINES-PRINTED\nIN U.S.A.\n2015166.1128"
    ],
